    "intro": {
      "zh": "Apple II 是苹果公司第一台面向普通家庭与学校的大规模量产个人电脑，1977 年 4 月在西岸计算机展发布。设计师沃兹尼亚克把彩色图形、集成键盘、内置 BASIC、开关电源和八个开放扩展槽装进一个塑料机箱，让个人电脑第一次成为开箱即用的家用电器。它与 Commodore PET 2001、TRS-80 Model I 并称 1977 三巨头；1978 年的 Disk II 软驱与 1979 年的 VisiCalc 电子表格让它在商业与教育市场大获成功，成为个人电脑史上最具影响力的机型之一。",
      "en": "The Apple II is Apple Computer's first mass-produced personal computer aimed at home and school, released in April 1977 at the West Coast Computer Faire. Designed by Steve Wozniak, it combined colour graphics, an integrated keyboard, BASIC in ROM, a switching power supply and eight open expansion slots in a single plastic case, making the personal computer a consumer appliance for the first time."
    },
    "era": 1977,
    "manufacturer": "Apple Computer, Inc."
